      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "日葵.玉蜀黍的播种面积占全部土地的30%，小麦播",
        "种面积比向日葵多5948.3公顷.每种作物的播种面积",
        "是多少公顷？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "478",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "$29640:52+(412\\cdot218-28782:117)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "479",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把每个分数化成小数并计算：",
        "1) $\\left(\\frac{7}{8}+\\frac{3}{4}\\right):\\frac{1}{2}$；2) $7\\frac{6}{25}:\\left(1\\frac{1}{2}+1\\frac{1}{4}\\right)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "26. 作两点的对称轴"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假定点$A$和点$B$关于直线$l$对称（图",
        "103）.在这条直线上取任意点$C$.线段",
        "$AC$和$CB$相互对称.这就是说，这两条线",
        "段合同，长度也相等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 103",
      "box": [
        993,
        927,
        253,
        289
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-103"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对称轴上每个点到关于这个轴对称的",
        "两点$A$与$B$的距离相等."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 103",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "只有对称轴上的点才具有这种性质，这就是和两点$A,B$",
        "等距离的所有点都在这两点的对称轴上."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题.作$A,B$两点的对称轴."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作与点$A,B$等距的点$C$和$D$（图",
        "104）.为此，分别以点$A,B$为圆心，",
        "以相同的半径作相交的两个圆周，过",
        "这两个圆周的交点$C,D$引直线.因"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 104",
      "box": [
        932,
        1465,
        390,
        307
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-104"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 104",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为$|AC|=|BC|$，$|AD|=|BD|$，所以直线$CD$是$A,B$两点的",
        "对称轴."
      ]
    },
